WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.248 --> 00:00:02.321
(dramatic music)
- [Voiceover] Previously

00:00:02.321 --> 00:00:03.605
on The Roomate.

00:00:04.605 --> 00:00:07.043
- Quinta makes me feel like a desired man.

00:00:07.043 --> 00:00:10.294
I feel a real connection.

00:00:10.294 --> 00:00:11.501
Everything just feels right.

00:00:11.501 --> 00:00:13.846
- Seeing Justin with
another potential roommate

00:00:13.846 --> 00:00:15.908
makes me question everything we have.

00:00:15.908 --> 00:00:18.184
He told be off camera that I was the one,

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:20.715
but then he confessed to
me that he ordered takeout

00:00:20.715 --> 00:00:22.636
at my favorite place with Quinta.

00:00:22.636 --> 00:00:23.565
Hey there.

00:00:23.565 --> 00:00:25.283
You mind if I steal him away?

00:00:25.283 --> 00:00:26.862
I just don't trust her, OK?

00:00:26.862 --> 00:00:28.070
There's just something about her.

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:29.370
She's just not being faithful.

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:31.087
- [Justin] What?

00:00:31.087 --> 00:00:32.016
- [Zach] That's all I'm gonna say.

00:00:32.016 --> 00:00:34.547
- Honestly, I just need to
know if he's gonna live with

00:00:34.547 --> 00:00:35.221
me or Zach.

00:00:35.221 --> 00:00:36.289
I don't really care,

00:00:36.289 --> 00:00:37.403
I just need to know.

00:00:37.403 --> 00:00:40.399
- At this point I just
don't know, I (sniffles).

00:00:40.399 --> 00:00:41.885
- Justin, do you like the
way the bathroom smells

00:00:41.885 --> 00:00:43.603
after he as Chick-fil-A?

00:00:45.023 --> 00:00:47.497
- I would prefer if you burn some sage.

00:00:47.497 --> 00:00:49.169
I just want someone I can trust.

00:00:49.169 --> 00:00:51.189
Pay the rent on time every month.

00:00:51.189 --> 00:00:52.605
- Let the games begin.

00:00:52.605 --> 00:00:54.323
- [Voiceover] The drama continues

00:00:54.323 --> 00:00:56.012
on The Roommate.

00:00:56.012 --> 00:00:57.452
- [Justin] Today

00:00:57.452 --> 00:01:01.515
I will make the hardest
decision of my life,

00:01:01.515 --> 00:01:03.259
to live with my girlfriend Quinta,

00:01:03.259 --> 00:01:05.567
or my best friend Zack.

00:01:05.567 --> 00:01:06.597
These past weeks I've felt

00:01:06.597 --> 00:01:08.779
a really special connection with Justin,

00:01:08.779 --> 00:01:10.215
and I think he did too, but

00:01:10.215 --> 00:01:11.609
if he chooses Quinta

00:01:11.609 --> 00:01:14.418
I don't think I could
ever talk to him again.

00:01:14.418 --> 00:01:16.756
- I've gotta look at
another apartment in like

00:01:16.756 --> 00:01:17.871
20 minutes,

00:01:17.871 --> 00:01:20.146
so I just hope this doesn't make me late.

00:01:20.146 --> 00:01:21.751
I honestly don't know
why I agreed to this.

00:01:21.751 --> 00:01:24.310
- OK, guys, I have the final key here, and

00:01:24.310 --> 00:01:26.909
I'll need you to pick one of
these final two contestants

00:01:26.909 --> 00:01:28.696
to sign that lease with you.

00:01:28.696 --> 00:01:30.003
So.

00:01:30.003 --> 00:01:31.019
- [Justin] Thank you.
- Just.

00:01:31.019 --> 00:01:33.344
- These past 29 weeks have been

00:01:33.344 --> 00:01:34.018
magical.

00:01:34.018 --> 00:01:36.990
Zach, we've had some
amazing times together.

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:39.126
We've beaten every level of Call of Duty,

00:01:39.126 --> 00:01:40.890
and we binged all of Entourage.

00:01:40.890 --> 00:01:42.621
I seriously view you as my Turtle.

00:01:42.621 --> 00:01:44.061
- And you're my Johnny Drama.

00:01:44.061 --> 00:01:45.129
- And Quinta.

00:01:45.129 --> 00:01:46.708
You're my dream come true.

00:01:46.708 --> 00:01:48.399
You like my cats, if you lived here

00:01:48.399 --> 00:01:50.651
I could see us throwing
some pretty sick ragers.

00:01:50.651 --> 00:01:52.038
I could definitely see myself spending

00:01:52.038 --> 00:01:53.570
the rest of my lease with you.

00:01:53.570 --> 00:01:55.590
However, there can only be one.

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:57.425
(melodramatic music)

00:01:57.425 --> 00:01:58.446
- Quinta can I talk to you?

00:01:58.446 --> 00:02:01.957
(dramatic music)

00:02:01.957 --> 00:02:02.793
- What's going on?

00:02:02.793 --> 00:02:05.138
- I know you watched Game
of Thrones without Justin.

00:02:05.138 --> 00:02:07.344
- Oh my God, so what,
Zach? It doesn't matter.

00:02:07.344 --> 00:02:09.573
- You broke a sacred creed with him.

00:02:09.573 --> 00:02:10.525
- I don't know,

00:02:10.525 --> 00:02:11.666
I just know that, you know,
we need to get someone

00:02:11.666 --> 00:02:13.270
on that lease today, so--

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:14.431
- I know. OK.

00:02:14.431 --> 00:02:14.862
- Just.

00:02:14.862 --> 00:02:17.625
Make that decision, get that
security deposit in, and--

00:02:17.625 --> 00:02:18.368
- Sure.

00:02:18.368 --> 00:02:19.436
- You're lying to his face.

00:02:19.436 --> 00:02:21.410
- Would you stop? It is
not that important, OK?

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:22.083
Just chill.

00:02:22.083 --> 00:02:24.051
So I did watch a few
episodes of Game of Thrones

00:02:24.051 --> 00:02:25.630
without Justin, I don't get it,

00:02:25.630 --> 00:02:26.999
why is Zach acting like this?

00:02:26.999 --> 00:02:29.321
Oh my God, ya'll are so annoying.

00:02:29.321 --> 00:02:32.393
- I'm acting like this because
Quinta is a lying cheat.

00:02:32.393 --> 00:02:34.692
She's gonna have to
tell Justin before I do.

00:02:34.692 --> 00:02:35.374
- You OK?

00:02:36.116 --> 00:02:36.587
- Yea.

00:02:36.587 --> 00:02:38.073
I'm just a little shaken.

00:02:38.733 --> 00:02:40.014
Guys, what,

00:02:40.014 --> 00:02:41.430
what happened? What's going on?

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:42.893
- Quinta

00:02:42.893 --> 00:02:44.914
has something to say.

00:02:48.031 --> 00:02:50.121
- Justin I watched three episodes

00:02:50.121 --> 00:02:52.049
of Game of Thrones without you--

00:02:52.049 --> 00:02:52.848
- [Justin] Oh my gosh.
- OK.

00:02:52.848 --> 00:02:54.058
And I'm sorry.

00:02:55.387 --> 00:02:56.376
- Oh my God.

00:02:57.779 --> 00:02:58.605
Quinta.

00:02:59.892 --> 00:03:00.846
How could you?

00:03:00.846 --> 00:03:02.637
(sobbing) I can't believe she
would do something like this

00:03:02.637 --> 00:03:06.383
to me, I feel so betrayed (sobbing).

00:03:06.383 --> 00:03:07.480
(sniffling)

00:03:07.480 --> 00:03:10.289
I trusted her with my HBO GO password.

00:03:10.289 --> 00:03:11.845
I guess

00:03:11.845 --> 00:03:13.587
there's only one choice.

00:03:13.587 --> 00:03:15.398
Zach,

00:03:15.398 --> 00:03:17.023
will you

00:03:17.023 --> 00:03:18.137
accept this key?

00:03:18.137 --> 00:03:19.600
- (sobbing) Oh my God.

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:20.622
Yes.

00:03:20.622 --> 00:03:22.061
Yes (sobbing).

00:03:22.061 --> 00:03:24.523
This is the greatest day of my life, I

00:03:24.523 --> 00:03:26.403
get the roommate of my dreams.

00:03:26.403 --> 00:03:27.680
- Zach,

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:29.538
he's the one. I know it.

00:03:29.538 --> 00:03:32.162
- Yes, tomorrow at five,
is that good for you?

00:03:32.162 --> 00:03:33.996
Oh sorry, hold on one second.

00:03:34.606 --> 00:03:36.411
I knew this was gonna happen and honestly,

00:03:36.411 --> 00:03:37.369
I could care less.

00:03:37.369 --> 00:03:40.478
I've set up three meetings
with three future tomorrow, so,

00:03:40.478 --> 00:03:41.389
it's all good.

00:03:41.389 --> 00:03:42.573
- Hey, uh,

00:03:42.573 --> 00:03:43.920
you know

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:45.763
we have to share a bathroom
at the new place, right?

00:03:45.763 --> 00:03:46.565
- Wait, what?

00:03:46.565 --> 00:03:47.656
- I'm sorry.

00:03:48.308 --> 00:03:49.382
I shoulda told you.
- No.

00:03:49.382 --> 00:03:53.306
(upbeat music)

00:03:53.306 --> 00:03:54.564
(acoustic guitar melody)

00:03:54.564 --> 00:03:57.872
♫ Justin won't you be my roommate ♫

00:03:57.872 --> 00:04:01.813
♫ Zach I will be your roommate ♫

